00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:41.350
Where do you think you're coming from?!

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:42.680
Hey there, Momo.

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.150
Who is she?

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:45.560
Is she from a Shaolin Temple?

00:13:45.560 --> 00:13:46.640
Her?

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:48.600
She's Amamiya Manami, a transfer student.

00:13:48.600 --> 00:13:49.950
She calls herself Manabi.

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:51.330
She's awesome.

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.420
I think there's a high probability that she's an alien.

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:55.280
A Manabian?

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:05.600
Well then, let's do that, okay?

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:06.920
Shimojima-sensei.

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:07.860
Yeah.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:10.580
It's great that she is so energetic,

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:13.840
but it seems like she has a habit of taking problematic actions...

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:15.590
Did I say something wrong?

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:17.800
Everyone, please be quiet.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:21.270
It is against my will to intervene in the general assembly,

00:14:21.270 --> 00:14:24.010
since it is the place where students self-govern,

00:14:24.220 --> 00:14:30.830
but we shall temporarily defer the candidacy of Amamiya Manami-san for now.

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:34.190
I appreciate her nominating herself to run for office,

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:36.680
but Amamiya-san just transferred to our school.

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:39.360
So she is probably unfamiliar with the Student Council here.

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:40.600
I do understand!
Therefore-

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:41.110
I do understand!

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:46.160
U-Understand?

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:52.760
A student council works to enrich and improve campus life,

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:56.710
coordinates all student activities,

00:14:56.710 --> 00:14:59.550
helps out at all school events and...

00:14:59.550 --> 00:15:03.860
...volunteer activities; an organization where students take their own actions!

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:07.680
In other words, the Student Council is...

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:10.690
...a place to make student life more fun...

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:11.690
...more wonderful...

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:13.810
...and more spectacular...

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:15.900
...by gathering everyone's power...

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:17.660
...and working hard to achieve that goal!

00:15:20.820 --> 00:15:23.980
A-Amamiya-san, that's not what I meant-

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:26.030
As long as you're a student of Seioh...

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:28.340
...and as long as you love this school,

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:30.950
there are no other requirements, Mikan-chan said.

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:31.850
Huh?

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:37.130
As long as you're a student of Seioh...

00:15:37.130 --> 00:15:39.330
...and as long as you love this school,

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:40.800
there are no requirements.

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:42.930
Your logic makes sense.

00:15:42.930 --> 00:15:44.760
Shimojima-sensei.

00:15:44.760 --> 00:15:45.760
But...

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:48.930
Can you say what you love about this school?

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:52.930
Chairman,

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:54.230
may I say something?

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:55.690
Ah, she stood up.

00:15:56.320 --> 00:15:57.530
Ah, yes.

00:15:57.530 --> 00:15:58.520
G-Go ahead.

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:01.160
We're wasting time here.

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:03.240
Please get on with the general assembly already.

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:06.120
But we're currently deciding on what to do with her nomination.

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:10.390
At this rate, this stupid gathering won't be ending until after noon!

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:12.640
No matter who becomes
Student Council President, it's the same!

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:13.750
So it doesn't really matter, right?

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:18.110
Mei-tan, getting angry too often isn't good for your skin.

00:16:18.110 --> 00:16:19.780
Getting angry will also make you hungry,

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:21.820
and you'll get fat by eating.

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:23.790
And you, a Taurus, are Miss Metabolic Syndrome.

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:24.120
That makes no sense.

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.060
Quiet!
That makes no sense.

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:25.590
Quiet!

00:16:25.590 --> 00:16:28.030
Anyway, please get going already!

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:30.760
Did you want this?

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:33.230
Umm, ahh...

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:36.020
Then, a vote!

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:38.020
Let's decide this with a vote!

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:42.780
Those that are in favor of Amamiya Manami-san's nomination, clap your hands!

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:44.990
Yes, clap your hands!

00:16:46.530 --> 00:16:48.280
That's kind of unreasonable.

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:54.590
Also, asking for a student that just transferred in
to be Student Council President is unreasonable, too.

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:04.630
I, Amamiya Manami, shall sing a song now.

00:17:06.470 --> 00:17:17.360
Live the present moment, the season of encounters.
