PLACEHOLDER
Hey, isn't this...

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:39.540
Yeah, it's our school anthem.
PLACEHOLDER

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:42.140
Cherry-blossom colored futures fly into the sky.
Yeah, it's our school anthem.
PLACEHOLDER

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:49.620
PLACEHOLDER
Cherry-blossom colored futures fly into the sky.

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:50.120
PLACEHOLDER

00:17:50.120 --> 00:18:03.740
Ah, the cheerful sounds of Seioh!
PLACEHOLDER

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:04.190
PLACEHOLDER

00:18:04.190 --> 00:18:18.470
Ah, let the beauty of learning at Seioh resonate!
PLACEHOLDER

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:18.760
PLACEHOLDER

