PLACEHOLDER

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:32.410
When we shine, we shine with our friends.

00:19:55.830 --> 00:19:57.780
Hearing our school anthem properly...

00:19:57.780 --> 00:20:01.400
You realize it's a pretty nice song.

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:07.940
Yesterday, when I heard this song at the swimming tournament, I told myself...

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:11.410
...that I will definitely love Seioh!

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:13.740
Is this feeling not enough?

00:20:31.150 --> 00:20:33.700
By majority vote, Manabi-chan-

00:20:33.700 --> 00:20:39.470
I mean, Amamiya Manami-san has been sworn in as the new Seioh Student Council President!

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:46.350
Mikan-chan.

00:20:51.440 --> 00:20:56.660
Seioh High School and Seioh Student Council, fight-o!

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:58.400
Ohh!

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:00.920
Hey, President!

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:03.620
Hey, as long as it's decided, it's good.

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:06.670
Mei-tan, not being honest with herself.

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:08.240
Thank you!

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:10.230
Thank you very much!

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:13.130
I look forward to working with you, Manabi-chan.

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:14.630
Same here.

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:19.340
So, I would like to proceed to the next item.

00:21:21.770 --> 00:21:27.410
And thus, the Seioh Student Council embraced its new President.

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:31.780
Uhh... I doubt we need to introduce her at this point,

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:34.230
but here's our new classmate-

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:38.490
Amamiya Manami!

00:21:38.490 --> 00:21:39.530
Call me Manabi!

00:21:39.530 --> 00:21:43.380
My motto is "Forward, go!"

00:21:44.300 --> 00:21:45.410
Hey!

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:46.710
Yo!

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:54.180
Manabi-chan, an energetic and cheerful,

00:21:54.180 --> 00:21:56.390
and just a bit mysterious girl.

00:21:56.390 --> 00:22:00.570
Somehow, I feel that life at school might just get a bit more fun.

00:22:00.570 --> 00:22:05.550
Signed - Seioh High School Student Council Secretary, Inamori Mika.

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:18.300
We're still at the very beginning of things.

00:22:20.190 --> 00:22:25.050
Even the thousand-mile road starts with a first step.

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:31.980
There's a first time for everyone,

00:22:32.190 --> 00:22:39.520
so take it on fearlessly - that's the best way to go

00:22:41.840 --> 00:22:48.800
I'm glad I chose a path I love,

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:56.010
so thank you, God.

00:22:58.820 --> 00:23:04.310
I want to treasure my luck right now

00:23:04.530 --> 00:23:07.610
And stay happy on the way.

00:23:07.810 --> 00:23:11.450
Come on, let's ride on the momentum

00:23:11.710 --> 00:23:14.240
Bang！Bang！Bang！

00:23:14.300 --> 00:23:16.410
That's right, Lucky!

00:23:16.450 --> 00:23:20.000
Now is the time, happy!

00:23:20.060 --> 00:23:23.130
Grab your chances

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:28.300
And live your lives to the fullest...

00:23:40.770 --> 00:23:47.610
Episode 2 "Forward, GO!"
